1
00:00:00,590 --> 00:00:02,970
[MÖGE] It seems
the Great Kha'an was poisoned.

2
00:00:03,050 --> 00:00:05,680
But still,
if it really wasn't you,

3
00:00:05,760 --> 00:00:06,800
then that would mean

4
00:00:06,890 --> 00:00:08,100
-it was Töregene.
-[gasps]

5
00:00:09,640 --> 00:00:11,520
[KAM] The guardian spirits
have spoken,

6
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:13,190
and they tell us
that saving the patient

7
00:00:13,270 --> 00:00:15,520
will require a sacrifice
in his stead.

8
00:00:15,610 --> 00:00:18,940
One of you must drink
every last drop of this water.

9
00:00:21,070 --> 00:00:22,860
Well then, looks like I'm up.

10
00:00:22,950 --> 00:00:24,070
♪

11
00:00:28,620 --> 00:00:29,700
[sighs]

12
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:38,960
[♪ opening theme song playing]

13
00:02:13,180 --> 00:02:14,680
[Ögedei groans]

14
00:02:17,850 --> 00:02:19,150
I'm in pain.

15
00:02:20,770 --> 00:02:22,190
And I can't move.

16
00:02:25,280 --> 00:02:26,990
-[birds squawking]
-[ÖGEDEI] I must be...

17
00:02:27,690 --> 00:02:29,700
deep within the lower world.

18
00:02:30,820 --> 00:02:32,450
The immortal realm...

19
00:02:33,410 --> 00:02:35,330
where all the spirits
are said to dwell.

20
00:02:35,410 --> 00:02:36,370
[dog barks]

21
00:02:36,830 --> 00:02:38,790
Not even the kams themselves
would dare venture

22
00:02:38,870 --> 00:02:41,040
so deep in search of a soul.

23
00:02:42,420 --> 00:02:45,630
Is it now my fate to be held
captive here for eternity?

24
00:02:45,920 --> 00:02:47,050
[TOLUI] Brother!

25
00:02:47,130 --> 00:02:48,130
[Ögedei gasps]

26
00:02:48,220 --> 00:02:49,590
[footsteps]

27
00:02:49,680 --> 00:02:52,720
[TOLUI] So, this is where
you were, Ögedei.

28
00:02:52,800 --> 00:02:55,010
[ÖGEDEI] Tolui?
Why are you here?

29
00:02:55,100 --> 00:02:56,100
[Tolui grunts]

30
00:02:56,390 --> 00:02:58,680
I can't tell you how long
I have searched.

31
00:02:58,770 --> 00:03:01,350
After scouring
the upper and lower worlds,

32
00:03:01,440 --> 00:03:03,230
it seems I've finally found you.

33
00:03:03,310 --> 00:03:05,440
Come. Let's return.

34
00:03:07,190 --> 00:03:11,490
Tolui, I'm afraid
that will not be possible.

35
00:03:11,570 --> 00:03:12,570
[TOLUI] Uh?

36
00:03:13,370 --> 00:03:16,200
[ÖGEDEI] If a single soul were
to go missing from this tent,

37
00:03:16,280 --> 00:03:18,660
the spirits would
surely take notice.

38
00:03:18,750 --> 00:03:22,330
In anger, they could wreak havoc
upon the surface.

39
00:03:31,300 --> 00:03:33,010
[animals whine]

40
00:03:34,720 --> 00:03:37,640
Then you must allow me
to switch places with you.

41
00:03:37,720 --> 00:03:38,810
[ÖGEDEI] Huh?

42
00:03:40,850 --> 00:03:42,770
Tolui, please don't.

43
00:03:43,400 --> 00:03:46,440
Come now, all that
I've ever known is war.

44
00:03:46,520 --> 00:03:49,400
We've already vanquished
our longtime foes, the Jin.

45
00:03:49,490 --> 00:03:52,070
[laughs]

46
00:03:52,160 --> 00:03:53,200
♪

47
00:03:56,870 --> 00:03:58,030
Hmm.

48
00:03:58,120 --> 00:03:59,540
[Ögedei gasps]

49
00:03:59,620 --> 00:04:00,620
♪

50
00:04:04,380 --> 00:04:06,960
[TOLUI] You're the one
who'll forge the era

51
00:04:07,040 --> 00:04:08,750
to come with your cleverness.

52
00:04:08,840 --> 00:04:10,170
[ÖGEDEI] No! Tolui!

53
00:04:12,220 --> 00:04:14,260
Farewell, brother.

54
00:04:17,180 --> 00:04:19,430
[ÖGEDEI] Tolui!

55
00:04:19,510 --> 00:04:22,390
When you're back, I would like
for you to be careful.

56
00:04:23,230 --> 00:04:25,350
And in my stead,

57
00:04:25,440 --> 00:04:28,230
please watch over
Sorghaghtani for me!

58
00:04:28,320 --> 00:04:29,480
♪

59
00:04:32,150 --> 00:04:33,450
[Ögedei gasps]

60
00:04:33,530 --> 00:04:35,700
[breathes heavily]

61
00:04:41,040 --> 00:04:42,290
Great Kha'an.

62
00:04:43,160 --> 00:04:44,080
[chuckles]

63
00:04:44,170 --> 00:04:45,170
You've awakened.

64
00:04:46,960 --> 00:04:48,840
Boraqchin? [grunts]

65
00:04:50,000 --> 00:04:53,090
Where's Tolui?
Where is brother right now?

66
00:04:57,850 --> 00:04:58,970
[Boraqchin exhales]

67
00:05:00,640 --> 00:05:01,640
[Ögedei gasps]

68
00:05:03,600 --> 00:05:05,100
[footsteps receding]

69
00:05:05,730 --> 00:05:09,110
Everyone,
the Great Kha'an has come to.

70
00:05:10,520 --> 00:05:12,740
[cries]

71
00:05:13,490 --> 00:05:14,490
Tolui.

72
00:05:16,240 --> 00:05:17,620
[bleating]

73
00:05:21,990 --> 00:05:23,330
Uh? [gasps]

74
00:05:25,580 --> 00:05:29,330
Sir Qadaq's tent is gone.
How can this be?

75
00:05:30,380 --> 00:05:32,170
I needed to speak with him.

76
00:05:32,250 --> 00:05:35,050
Surely he knew what happened
to Lady Töregene.

77
00:05:35,130 --> 00:05:36,470
-[clink]
-Huh?

78
00:05:40,560 --> 00:05:41,760
This is...

79
00:05:41,850 --> 00:05:43,430
[Shira shouts] Fatima!

80
00:05:44,520 --> 00:05:45,980
-[pants]
-[SITARA] Shira?

81
00:05:51,150 --> 00:05:53,280
Prince Tolui has...
[breathes shakily]

82
00:05:53,650 --> 00:05:55,030
[Sitara breathes uneasily]

83
00:05:56,740 --> 00:05:57,860
What?

84
00:06:01,700 --> 00:06:03,580
[SHIRA]
It happened after the exorcism.

85
00:06:06,870 --> 00:06:08,460
[gasps]

86
00:06:08,540 --> 00:06:09,960
[neighs]

87
00:06:10,540 --> 00:06:12,800
[SHIRA] On his way back home
with the others,

88
00:06:12,880 --> 00:06:15,510
Prince Tolui suddenly had a fit.

89
00:06:15,590 --> 00:06:17,010
♪

90
00:06:21,550 --> 00:06:23,310
[Tolui grunting]

91
00:06:27,890 --> 00:06:29,190
[Sorghaghtani gasps]

92
00:06:30,810 --> 00:06:33,610
[SHIRA] He managed to return
to Princess Sorghaghtani's side.

93
00:06:36,400 --> 00:06:39,530
-But soon after, perished.
-[Sorghaghtani cries]

94
00:06:39,610 --> 00:06:41,120
♪

95
00:06:51,880 --> 00:06:53,840
[Shira sighs] It seems...

96
00:06:53,920 --> 00:06:56,460
he really did choose
to sacrifice himself.

97
00:06:56,880 --> 00:06:59,050
[SITARA] That can't be.

98
00:06:59,130 --> 00:07:01,130
The very thought is absurd.

99
00:07:01,220 --> 00:07:02,350
[Shira exhales]

100
00:07:02,430 --> 00:07:04,430
Which would mean he was...

101
00:07:04,510 --> 00:07:05,970
[Sitara gasps]

102
00:07:07,270 --> 00:07:08,680
Assassinated?

103
00:07:10,310 --> 00:07:13,900
Hold on. With everything that's
happened since yesterday,

104
00:07:13,980 --> 00:07:15,520
I feel so confused.

105
00:07:15,610 --> 00:07:20,700
Fatima, perhaps you shouldn't
go back to the House of Tolui.

106
00:07:20,780 --> 00:07:22,700
-[gasps]
-The Princess sent you

107
00:07:22,780 --> 00:07:25,330
to try and prevent
the very worst from occurring.

108
00:07:25,410 --> 00:07:28,040
And yet, that is precisely
what happened.

109
00:07:28,120 --> 00:07:30,290
So, she'll think
you've betrayed her trust.

110
00:07:30,790 --> 00:07:32,000
[Sitara gasps softly]

111
00:07:32,380 --> 00:07:36,170
Besides, now
that Prince Tolui isn't around,

112
00:07:36,250 --> 00:07:37,920
his house won't last long.

113
00:07:38,000 --> 00:07:39,300
[Sitara gasps]

114
00:07:39,380 --> 00:07:40,680
[SHIRA] From now on,

115
00:07:40,760 --> 00:07:43,010
the Great Kha'an
may have all the power.

116
00:07:43,640 --> 00:07:45,260
Should that be the case,

117
00:07:45,350 --> 00:07:47,850
I would love to serve
the House of Ögedei.

118
00:07:47,930 --> 00:07:48,970
[gasps]

119
00:07:49,060 --> 00:07:51,190
Say, Fatima...

120
00:07:51,270 --> 00:07:54,060
Do you think you could
put in a good word for me?

121
00:07:54,480 --> 00:07:56,360
Hey! Uh, you listening?

122
00:08:06,070 --> 00:08:08,240
[SITARA (ADULT)]
Tolui sacrificed his life

123
00:08:08,330 --> 00:08:10,830
so the Great Kha'an could live.

124
00:08:11,330 --> 00:08:14,210
While that may very well
be the truth,

125
00:08:14,290 --> 00:08:16,960
it could just as easily not be.

126
00:08:17,710 --> 00:08:19,670
But one thing is certain,

127
00:08:19,750 --> 00:08:22,380
following the death
of Prince Tolui,

128
00:08:22,470 --> 00:08:24,680
the power imbalance
that once prevailed

129
00:08:24,760 --> 00:08:26,180
within the empire...

130
00:08:26,760 --> 00:08:30,180
was about to undergo
an immeasurable shift.

131
00:08:32,520 --> 00:08:36,060
I now present
the jarghuchi, Shigi Qutuqu,

132
00:08:36,150 --> 00:08:38,520
who'll be announcing
the spoils of war.

133
00:08:40,570 --> 00:08:43,820
Here are the men we brought back
from the capital of Jin.

134
00:08:44,860 --> 00:08:46,070
-Scholars...
-Yes.

135
00:08:46,160 --> 00:08:47,990
...physicians, engineers.

136
00:08:48,080 --> 00:08:51,160
They're sure to contribute
to our nation's development.

137
00:08:52,580 --> 00:08:55,080
So this is the gift
you mentioned?

138
00:09:01,630 --> 00:09:03,380
Did you call for me?

139
00:09:05,380 --> 00:09:07,180
I spoke to the jarghuchi.

140
00:09:07,640 --> 00:09:09,260
He told me you went
against the law

141
00:09:09,350 --> 00:09:11,970
by arguing for more land
and subjects for your son.

142
00:09:12,060 --> 00:09:13,680
[Kirgistani yelps]

143
00:09:15,520 --> 00:09:17,770
[KIRGISTANI] My son made
valuable contributions

144
00:09:17,860 --> 00:09:19,190
to the Jin expedition!

145
00:09:19,270 --> 00:09:21,230
You do realize
what he accomplished,

146
00:09:21,320 --> 00:09:22,400
-don't you?
-Mother!

147
00:09:22,490 --> 00:09:24,110
[Kirgistani screaming]

148
00:09:24,200 --> 00:09:26,650
-Pardon us. Pay her no mind.
-[KIRGISTANI] Godan!

149
00:09:26,740 --> 00:09:28,950
[GODAN] Mother, please!
Try and calm down, all right?

150
00:09:29,030 --> 00:09:31,450
Wait! Ow! Let go! That hurts!
[screams]

151
00:09:31,530 --> 00:09:35,330
[laughs nervously]
Well, you see, uh...

152
00:09:35,410 --> 00:09:39,380
That wish of yours
may be granted soon enough.

153
00:09:39,460 --> 00:09:40,670
[KIRGISTANI] Uh...

154
00:09:41,590 --> 00:09:42,500
Huh?

155
00:09:43,920 --> 00:09:46,220
[Boraqchin chuckles]

156
00:09:55,560 --> 00:09:56,520
[Sitara gasps]

157
00:09:56,600 --> 00:09:58,650
-[grunts] Right there.
-Huh?

158
00:09:58,730 --> 00:10:00,020
-[exclaims]
-[chuckles]

159
00:10:03,480 --> 00:10:04,650
[Sitara sighs]

160
00:10:06,820 --> 00:10:07,990
[BORAQCHIN] Fatima.

161
00:10:08,070 --> 00:10:09,070
[Sitara gasps]

162
00:10:09,490 --> 00:10:10,830
It's the Empress.

163
00:10:13,660 --> 00:10:15,290
What brings you here?

164
00:10:15,370 --> 00:10:16,910
[BORAQCHIN]
Your selfless efforts

165
00:10:17,000 --> 00:10:19,630
have made the Great Kha'an's
recovery possible.

166
00:10:20,330 --> 00:10:22,250
And to show my gratitude...

167
00:10:23,880 --> 00:10:25,920
I want you to have this.

168
00:10:26,840 --> 00:10:28,010
[SITARA] What?

169
00:10:29,880 --> 00:10:31,510
"Elements?"

170
00:10:32,010 --> 00:10:33,760
[BORAQCHIN]
I mentioned to Sorghaghtani

171
00:10:33,850 --> 00:10:35,930
that you had
long been seeking this book,

172
00:10:36,020 --> 00:10:38,230
and she gladly agreed
to part with it.

173
00:10:39,060 --> 00:10:40,860
[SITARA]
That I had been seeking it...

174
00:10:42,310 --> 00:10:44,770
[gasps] How did you know?

175
00:10:44,860 --> 00:10:45,990
[Boraqchin chuckles]

176
00:10:46,400 --> 00:10:48,360
[SITARA]
Did Lady Töregene tell you?

177
00:10:48,450 --> 00:10:50,320
-Fatima.
-Uh?

178
00:10:50,820 --> 00:10:53,490
You need to forget
about that woman now.

179
00:10:53,580 --> 00:10:54,620
[Sitara gasps]

180
00:10:55,240 --> 00:10:56,870
[BORAQCHIN]
I'll have her tent dismantled

181
00:10:56,950 --> 00:10:58,290
by the end of today.

182
00:10:58,910 --> 00:11:01,960
You can relocate
next to my tent immediately.

183
00:11:03,290 --> 00:11:04,790
Empress Boraqchin.

184
00:11:04,880 --> 00:11:06,050
[BORAQCHIN] Come.

185
00:11:06,500 --> 00:11:08,420
There's something
I want to show you.

186
00:11:08,510 --> 00:11:09,380
[SITARA] Uh?

187
00:11:13,680 --> 00:11:15,260
[Sitara gasps]

188
00:11:15,350 --> 00:11:16,640
♪

189
00:11:20,390 --> 00:11:22,810
So, did Princess Sorghaghtani

190
00:11:22,900 --> 00:11:25,070
relinquish all these books
to you?

191
00:11:25,150 --> 00:11:27,780
Indeed. Rather graciously.

192
00:11:28,610 --> 00:11:31,360
Uh, yes, but she said...

193
00:11:32,160 --> 00:11:34,660
And I wish to learn more.
About the lands

194
00:11:34,740 --> 00:11:37,950
within reach of Mongol hooves,
and the ones even farther.

195
00:11:39,330 --> 00:11:40,710
[BORAQCHIN]
What happened to Tolui

196
00:11:40,790 --> 00:11:42,670
was unquestionably tragic.

197
00:11:43,130 --> 00:11:44,340
That said...

198
00:11:45,290 --> 00:11:48,050
I believe it was a portent
from the heavens.

199
00:11:48,130 --> 00:11:49,380
[Sitara gasps]

200
00:11:49,470 --> 00:11:52,760
For, you see, the Great Kha'an
has the wisdom

201
00:11:52,840 --> 00:11:55,260
to lead our empire
into a new age.

202
00:11:55,350 --> 00:11:58,430
Yet, Tolui would have proved
quite meddlesome

203
00:11:58,510 --> 00:12:00,060
in bringing
all this to fruition.

204
00:12:01,310 --> 00:12:03,270
You told me as much yourself.

205
00:12:03,350 --> 00:12:05,560
You were afraid
of the House of Tolui

206
00:12:05,650 --> 00:12:08,270
dominating in both might
and intelligence.

207
00:12:08,360 --> 00:12:09,740
[Sitara gasps]

208
00:12:10,820 --> 00:12:12,150
But now,

209
00:12:12,950 --> 00:12:15,780
I have the chance
to fix that imbalance.

210
00:12:16,830 --> 00:12:19,410
Fatima, it won't be might

211
00:12:19,500 --> 00:12:21,460
that commands
this empire's future.

212
00:12:21,540 --> 00:12:23,210
It will be wisdom.

213
00:12:23,290 --> 00:12:25,750
Don't you wish to harness
your own wisdom

214
00:12:25,830 --> 00:12:27,500
to its fullest extent?

215
00:12:28,170 --> 00:12:30,970
Could you imagine anything
more enjoyable?

216
00:12:32,590 --> 00:12:34,430
[Sitara exclaims]

217
00:12:41,480 --> 00:12:43,180
[wind blows]

218
00:12:47,860 --> 00:12:49,190
[gasps]

219
00:12:50,360 --> 00:12:51,610
♪

220
00:12:58,620 --> 00:13:00,540
[SITARA] Had I stayed in Tus,

221
00:13:00,620 --> 00:13:03,750
I would never have beheld
a sight so majestic.

222
00:13:03,830 --> 00:13:07,130
That's why I'm leaving here
on a journey,

223
00:13:07,210 --> 00:13:09,290
to engage with wisdom,

224
00:13:09,960 --> 00:13:12,170
and search for truth.

225
00:13:12,970 --> 00:13:14,300
♪

226
00:13:16,510 --> 00:13:17,970
[SITARA] Master Muhammad...

227
00:13:18,760 --> 00:13:22,140
I felt so frustrated
watching you leave us that day.

228
00:13:23,350 --> 00:13:25,060
I was filled with envy.

229
00:13:25,730 --> 00:13:27,480
You were free
to journey anywhere,

230
00:13:27,560 --> 00:13:29,690
and follow your heart.

231
00:13:30,230 --> 00:13:31,360
♪

232
00:13:31,440 --> 00:13:33,150
I've already learned
and experienced

233
00:13:33,240 --> 00:13:35,200
far more than you ever did

234
00:13:35,280 --> 00:13:37,160
in the brief time
that you were alive.

235
00:13:38,450 --> 00:13:41,330
Maybe the moment's
finally come...

236
00:13:42,040 --> 00:13:44,960
for me to move on
with the rest of my life.

237
00:13:45,040 --> 00:13:47,120
[wind blows]

238
00:13:47,210 --> 00:13:48,630
-[loud clanging]
-[gasps]

239
00:13:50,750 --> 00:13:52,300
[clanging]

240
00:13:59,600 --> 00:14:01,300
[SOLDIER 1] Hold on.
What was that?

241
00:14:01,390 --> 00:14:02,850
[SOLDIER 2]
Uh, hey, you all right?

242
00:14:02,930 --> 00:14:05,430
[SOLDIER 3] I'm sorry.
This pillar just toppled over.

243
00:14:05,520 --> 00:14:06,600
[Sitara gasps]

244
00:14:06,890 --> 00:14:09,310
I thought surely
lightning had struck out here.

245
00:14:10,480 --> 00:14:11,860
[Sitara gasps]

246
00:14:13,070 --> 00:14:14,570
[Muhammad laughs]

247
00:14:14,650 --> 00:14:16,950
Everyone down there
was so afraid.

248
00:14:17,030 --> 00:14:18,320
♪

249
00:14:19,870 --> 00:14:22,990
As of now,
you have no idea where you are,

250
00:14:23,080 --> 00:14:24,540
what's really happening,

251
00:14:24,620 --> 00:14:26,540
or what is going
to become of you.

252
00:14:26,620 --> 00:14:28,750
Your life's full of unknowns.

253
00:14:31,920 --> 00:14:33,960
[SITARA] How could I have
possibly imagined

254
00:14:34,050 --> 00:14:36,170
I was cleverer
than Master Muhammad?

255
00:14:37,220 --> 00:14:39,380
Where is my true place
in this world?

256
00:14:41,600 --> 00:14:43,680
Euclid's Elements.

257
00:14:44,850 --> 00:14:48,020
The book my mistress
tried to protect.

258
00:14:48,770 --> 00:14:51,150
The book that would ultimately
be the cause

259
00:14:51,230 --> 00:14:53,230
of her tragic death.

260
00:14:53,980 --> 00:14:57,490
The man who took
my mistress's life is no more.

261
00:14:58,700 --> 00:15:00,820
My single purpose in life

262
00:15:00,910 --> 00:15:03,030
was to somehow
retrieve that book

263
00:15:03,120 --> 00:15:05,030
and take it back as her slave.

264
00:15:05,620 --> 00:15:06,750
♪

265
00:15:07,160 --> 00:15:11,290
Mistress Fatima, I've succeeded
in what I set out to do.

266
00:15:14,500 --> 00:15:15,750
A slave?

267
00:15:16,250 --> 00:15:17,510
[gasps]

268
00:15:19,630 --> 00:15:21,130
Empress Boraqchin...

269
00:15:21,970 --> 00:15:24,220
Were you told
of my particular interest

270
00:15:24,300 --> 00:15:26,600
in this book,
and why I sought it out?

271
00:15:26,680 --> 00:15:27,850
[BORAQCHIN] Uh?

272
00:15:28,640 --> 00:15:31,640
I believe it's a treatise
on geometry, is it not?

273
00:15:32,400 --> 00:15:35,730
I was told you had an interest
in the subject for a long time.

274
00:15:35,820 --> 00:15:37,990
And that you take after
your father,

275
00:15:38,070 --> 00:15:39,950
who was a known scholar,
wasn't he?

276
00:15:40,030 --> 00:15:41,150
[Sitara gasps]

277
00:15:43,910 --> 00:15:45,030
[chuckles]

278
00:15:46,910 --> 00:15:49,790
Yes, it's just as you said.

279
00:15:53,330 --> 00:15:54,880
♪

280
00:16:01,920 --> 00:16:03,970
[SITARA]
Now I'm sure of one thing.

281
00:16:04,550 --> 00:16:07,140
Empress Boraqchin definitely
heard about this book

282
00:16:07,220 --> 00:16:08,640
from Lady Töregene.

283
00:16:09,520 --> 00:16:12,020
I can't guess
what might have transpired,

284
00:16:12,690 --> 00:16:14,940
but what I can say is...

285
00:16:15,940 --> 00:16:18,770
My name is Sitara. I am a slave.

286
00:16:19,650 --> 00:16:22,450
That's why
I chose to hide my past,

287
00:16:22,530 --> 00:16:25,030
and kept it a secret
from everyone I could.

288
00:16:25,740 --> 00:16:27,620
Please keep it a secret, too.

289
00:16:27,700 --> 00:16:29,290
[SITARA] Lady Töregene...

290
00:16:29,370 --> 00:16:33,250
never once divulged
the secrets we shared.

291
00:16:33,830 --> 00:16:35,960
Nor the anger we bear.

292
00:16:36,420 --> 00:16:37,790
♪

293
00:16:53,100 --> 00:16:54,730
[SHIRA] You worked hard today.

294
00:16:54,810 --> 00:16:56,100
[horse snorts]

295
00:17:16,920 --> 00:17:18,380
[sighs]

296
00:17:20,920 --> 00:17:23,710
[whistling]

297
00:17:25,840 --> 00:17:27,340
[continues whistling]

298
00:17:28,510 --> 00:17:30,010
-[SITARA] Shira.
-[SHIRA] Huh?

299
00:17:30,100 --> 00:17:31,430
Fatima?

300
00:17:31,520 --> 00:17:32,810
I thought I told you

301
00:17:32,890 --> 00:17:34,180
-not to come back here.
-I know.

302
00:17:34,270 --> 00:17:36,020
But I could use your help.

303
00:17:36,100 --> 00:17:38,270
Just answer my question,
and I'll introduce you

304
00:17:38,360 --> 00:17:40,440
to the Great Kha'an
or the Great Khatun.

305
00:17:40,860 --> 00:17:42,650
Very well, ask me anything.

306
00:17:43,480 --> 00:17:45,440
Before, you told me
the House of Tolui

307
00:17:45,530 --> 00:17:47,990
wouldn't last too long.
Why's that?

308
00:17:48,450 --> 00:17:50,830
Think about it.
With Prince Tolui gone,

309
00:17:50,910 --> 00:17:52,790
Princess Sorghaghtani
and the others

310
00:17:52,870 --> 00:17:55,750
probably won't be able to
hold onto their influence now.

311
00:17:56,540 --> 00:17:58,540
In fact, a little earlier...

312
00:18:00,420 --> 00:18:04,260
[HULEGU] But Mother, they took
so many of your books,

313
00:18:04,880 --> 00:18:07,680
and you're not saying anything?

314
00:18:07,760 --> 00:18:12,350
And that book, Elements,
if I'm not mistaken,

315
00:18:12,430 --> 00:18:15,140
didn't Father bring it
all the way from Persia for you?

316
00:18:16,230 --> 00:18:17,810
[SORGHAGHTANI] It's fine.

317
00:18:18,850 --> 00:18:22,570
At this point,
I've no further need for it.

318
00:18:22,650 --> 00:18:25,780
The Great Khatun can take
anything she wants.

319
00:18:26,400 --> 00:18:28,610
Ugh. I have no interest

320
00:18:28,700 --> 00:18:31,200
in following somebody
who's lost all hope.

321
00:18:32,240 --> 00:18:33,910
-[Sitara exhales]
-[gasps]

322
00:18:33,990 --> 00:18:36,950
[SITARA] It was...
It was her. [cries]

323
00:18:37,410 --> 00:18:41,500
I've been at the mercy
of Empress Boraqchin all along.

324
00:18:41,590 --> 00:18:42,710
I hate this.

325
00:18:43,840 --> 00:18:47,510
I believed I was smarter
than everyone around me,

326
00:18:47,590 --> 00:18:49,720
and challenged her
completely unaware.

327
00:18:49,800 --> 00:18:50,720
[Shira gasps softly]

328
00:18:50,800 --> 00:18:52,680
[Sitara cries]

329
00:18:56,970 --> 00:19:00,440
But right now isn't the time
to dwell on this.

330
00:19:03,400 --> 00:19:06,940
Shira, I beg you.
Please help me.

331
00:19:07,030 --> 00:19:09,900
There is someone
I need to save now. Chuu!

332
00:19:09,990 --> 00:19:11,280
[SHIRA] Uh, wait!

333
00:19:11,370 --> 00:19:14,030
Hold on.
Don't just leave me behind.

334
00:19:14,120 --> 00:19:15,660
[grunts, pants]

335
00:19:16,450 --> 00:19:17,410
Chuu!

336
00:19:18,410 --> 00:19:19,910
♪

337
00:20:09,960 --> 00:20:11,670
-[SITARA] Sir Qadaq...
-Uh?

338
00:20:11,760 --> 00:20:14,510
Fatima, you found me.

339
00:20:14,590 --> 00:20:18,180
Here. This is your
branding iron, am I right?

340
00:20:18,270 --> 00:20:19,270
[Qadaq gasps]

341
00:20:19,350 --> 00:20:21,020
-[breathes uneasily]
-[SITARA] Uh?

342
00:20:21,100 --> 00:20:22,600
[SITARA] Sir Qadaq...

343
00:20:22,690 --> 00:20:25,690
Where is Lady Töregene?
Please tell me she's safe!

344
00:20:28,940 --> 00:20:30,440
Let me assure you,

345
00:20:30,530 --> 00:20:33,740
I'm doing all I can
to make sure she's safe.

346
00:20:33,820 --> 00:20:35,570
On my master's orders, that is.

347
00:20:35,660 --> 00:20:38,700
-Master?
-Isn't that Lady Töregene?

348
00:20:38,790 --> 00:20:40,870
I've told you countless times,
she's not!

349
00:20:40,950 --> 00:20:42,000
[sighs]

350
00:20:42,460 --> 00:20:43,460
[grunts]

351
00:20:43,790 --> 00:20:46,630
It's a rather long story.
Come with me.

352
00:20:53,130 --> 00:20:55,590
[QADAQ]
Prince Güyük, I'm coming in.

353
00:20:56,760 --> 00:20:58,100
[Sitara gasps]

354
00:20:58,640 --> 00:21:00,140
There's no one here.

355
00:21:00,680 --> 00:21:03,890
[QADAQ]
Prince Güyük, it's me, Qadaq.

356
00:21:03,980 --> 00:21:05,270
[Güyük yelps]

357
00:21:05,350 --> 00:21:06,770
[whimpers]

358
00:21:08,940 --> 00:21:10,030
Qadaq?

359
00:21:10,440 --> 00:21:11,480
[BOTH] Huh?

360
00:21:11,570 --> 00:21:13,440
Oh, it's just you?

361
00:21:13,530 --> 00:21:15,200
I thought a stranger was...

362
00:21:15,280 --> 00:21:16,450
[yelps]

363
00:21:17,200 --> 00:21:18,580
[SITARA] Uh, an honor to--

364
00:21:18,660 --> 00:21:20,490
-[screaming]
-[all yelp]

365
00:21:20,580 --> 00:21:22,290
-[Qadaq sighs]
-[whimpers]

366
00:21:22,370 --> 00:21:25,540
[GÜYÜK] Qadaq! Qadaq!
Who is she? Send her away!

367
00:21:25,620 --> 00:21:26,880
[QADAQ] Well,
the prince's temperament

368
00:21:26,960 --> 00:21:28,750
can be quite unpredictable.

369
00:21:28,840 --> 00:21:31,460
Today is not your day. Get out.

370
00:21:31,550 --> 00:21:32,800
[BOTH] Huh?

371
00:21:32,880 --> 00:21:34,510
Come on, you aren't
really serious, are you?

372
00:21:35,050 --> 00:21:37,840
Qadaq,
what is the meaning of this?

373
00:21:37,930 --> 00:21:39,720
-It's like I said--
-[GÜYÜK] Qadaq!

374
00:21:39,800 --> 00:21:41,010
[Qadaq groans]

375
00:21:41,100 --> 00:21:43,270
I beg of you!
I don't know who that man is,

376
00:21:43,350 --> 00:21:45,230
but Lady Töregene
needs his help.

377
00:21:45,310 --> 00:21:47,480
[QADAQ] Well, this is
her firstborn son!

378
00:21:48,230 --> 00:21:50,730
[Güyük whimpering]

379
00:21:50,820 --> 00:21:52,190
[Qadaq sighs]

380
00:21:53,190 --> 00:21:57,280
The Great Kha'an
and Lady Töregene

381
00:21:57,360 --> 00:21:58,570
are his parents.

382
00:21:58,660 --> 00:22:00,160
[Sitara gasps]

383
00:22:00,780 --> 00:22:01,950
What?

384
00:22:02,040 --> 00:22:05,080
[♪ closing theme song playing]

385
00:23:32,130 --> 00:23:35,960
[SITARA (ADULT)] Next time,
"An Ungraceful Stone."

